Z||000000||cardealer||03-19-2001||10:41 AM||||as i am only week or so away from the swap, i am wanting to know how much of the existing harness do i need and do i "weed " out or cut out what i dont need? i assume i only need my computer, trans (auto), starter, alt.(?) i am using all new after market gauges and tach. <BR>many thanks !!!||||reg||5
